## Data Needed From Accounting / Internal Mapping

The accounting team or internal source of truth must provide these values before the CSV can be generated correctly.

| Internal Data Needed | Coupa Destination |
|---|---|
| Contractor name | Supplier mapping and/or invoice description. |
| Project name | Account segment, billing note, or tag. |
| Project ID / Budget ID | Account segment or account code. |
| Department code | Account dddsegment. |
| Cost center | Account segment. |
| CapEx vs OpEx | Account segment, category, tag, or custom field if configured. |
| Manager / approver | Requester fields or invoice header assignment. |
| Hours worked | Invoice line quantity. |
| Hourly rate | Invoice line price. |
| Total amount | Header gross/net and line total. |
| Clarity match result | Supplier note, billing notes, or internal audit table. |
| Exception reason | Supplier note or internal exception table if invoice is rejected before import. |

