## PDF / Attachment Workflow

Do not implement this for the first MVP.

Later, add a URL to the S3 bucket where the PDF image of the invoice is stored.

Future attachment fields may include:

| Field | Future Use |
|---|---|
| `Image Scan Filename` | Original invoice PDF filename. |
| `Image Scan URL` | S3 or hosted URL for invoice PDF. |
| `Attachment 1` | File reference or URL, depending on Coupa import setup. |

